$$
故
$$
\begin{aligned}
\int\frac{\mathrm{d}x}{a+b\cos x}
&=\int\frac{\frac{2\,\mathrm{d}t}{1+t^2}}
{a+b\frac{1-t^2}{1+t^2}}\\
&=2\int\frac{\mathrm{d}t}{a(1+t^2)+b(1-t^2)}
=2\int\frac{\mathrm{d}t}{a+b+at^2-bt^2}.
\end{aligned}
$$

当 $a<b$ 时，

$$
