5. 【答案】$\frac{3}{4}$

【解析】方法一
$$
\begin{aligned}
P\{X\geqslant Y\}
&=P\{X=0,Y=0\}+P\{X=1,Y=0\}+P\{X=1,Y=1\}\\
&=P\{X=0\}P\{Y=0\}+P\{X=1\}P\{Y=0\}+P\{X=1\}P\{Y=1\}\\
&=\frac{1}{2}\times\frac{1}{2}+\frac{1}{2}\times\frac{1}{2}+\frac{1}{2}\times\frac{1}{2}
=\frac{3}{4}.
\end{aligned}
$$

方法二
$$
\begin{aligned}
P\{X\geqslant Y\}
&=1-P\{X<Y\}
=1-P\{X=0,Y=1\}\\
&=1-P\{X=0\}P\{Y=1\}
=1-\frac{1}{2}\times\frac{1}{2}
=\frac{3}{4}.
\end{aligned}
$$

6. 【答案】$\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{\infty}p_k^2$

【解析】由于 $X$ 和 $Y$ 独立同分布，易得
$$
\begin{aligned}
P\{X=Y\}
&=\sum_{k=1}^{\infty}P\{X=Y=x_k\}\\
&=\sum_{k=1}^{\infty}P\{X=x_k\}P\{Y=x_k\}
=\sum_{k=1}^{\infty}p_k^2.
\end{aligned}
$$

